A||||6||DreXteR||Where 2 buy addco Sway Bars?????||||5||
Z||000000||DreXteR||03-01-2001||11:47 AM||||I need a place to buy addco swaybars with poly, cheap!!!<P>Thanx.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Oreif||03-01-2001||12:50 PM||||You can buy Addco's at JC Whitney. Addco's don't come with poly, you need to purchase the poly seperately. I bought the Suspension Tech sway bars from the Fiero Store. They are $149 each and come with all new hardware and poly. Tell them you belong to a Fiero club and get 10% off. With the 10% it's the same price as buying the Addco's and poly bushings but you get all new hardware too.||||reg||1
Z||000002||87ECO5||03-01-2001||03:11 PM||||I think  <A HREF="http://shox.com" TARGET=_blank>shox.com</A>  sells them.||||reg||1
Z||000003||DreXteR||03-01-2001||04:24 PM||||Damn!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>I place an order yesterday!! I didnt know about the 10% off!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Anyway thanx for tha info!||||reg||9
Z||000004||Haze_Performance||03-01-2001||05:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Tell them you belong to a Fiero club and get 10% off. With the 10% .</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hey Oreif,<BR> I was looking at the Fiero Store's Ocelot rebuilt distributor. Does the 10% discount apply to that? <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A>||||reg||5
Z||000005||Oreif||03-01-2001||08:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B> <BR>Hey Oreif,<BR> I was looking at the Fiero Store's Ocelot rebuilt distributor. Does the 10% discount apply to that? <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm not sure. Iknow for sure that the 10% does not apply to the OEM parts. They did give me 10% off the big bore TB so I would assume the Ocelot Distributor would be the same. Why get the rebuilt? I rebuilt mine for $52.00. I bought all the parts at Autozone and in an hour it was rebuilt. I followed Paul's guide on the NIFE website on how to dis-assemble the distributor and re-assemble.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Haze_Performance||03-02-2001||04:57 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B> I'm not sure. Iknow for sure that the 10% does not apply to the OEM parts. They did give me 10% off the big bore TB so I would assume the Ocelot Distributor would be the same. Why get the rebuilt? I rebuilt mine for $52.00. I bought all the parts at Autozone and in an hour it was rebuilt. I followed Paul's guide on the NIFE website on how to dis-assemble the distributor and re-assemble.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmmmmm rebuild huh? Thanks for the info.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A>||||reg||14
